{"meta":{"id":"tt0119698","type":"movie","name":"La princesa Mononoke","imdb_id":"tt0119698","description":"Tras sufrir el ataque de un monstruoso jabalí maldito, el joven Ashitaka emprende el camino en busca de la cura que detenga la infección. Mientras, los humanos están acabando con los bosques y los dioses convertidos en temibles bestias hacen todo lo posible por protegerlo encabezados por Mononoke, una princesa guerrera. Ashikata deberá escoger bando y decidir si ayudar a los hombres o las deidades intentando detener la maldición de su herida que se extiende por su cuerpo sin cuartel.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt0119698.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gl0jzn4BupSbL2qMVeqrjKkF9Js.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/slZ0Iwg0uUaMII7nMwXajmJ2hUs.png","genres":["Aventura","Fantasía","Animación"],"releaseInfo":"1997","released":"1997-07-12T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"134 min","imdbRating":"8.3","country":"Japan","cast":["松田洋治","石田ゆり子","田中裕子","小林薫","西村雅彥","上條恒彦","美輪明宏","森光子","森繁久彌","Sumi Shimamoto","渡辺哲","佐藤允","名古屋章","飯沼慧","都築香弥子","冷泉公裕","近藤芳正","坂本あきら","斎藤志郎","菅原大吉","加藤貴子","山本郁子","飯沼希歩","山本道子"],"director":["Hayao Miyazaki"],"writer":["Hayao Miyazaki"],"trailers":[{"source":"I1dHzoRl0sQ","type":"Trailer","name":"4K Restoration Official Trailer","ytId":"I1dHzoRl0sQ","lang":"en"},{"source":"opCxPAwdB6U","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer [Subtitled]","ytId":"opCxPAwdB6U","lang":"en"},{"source":"XWHzZ8R_zaI","type":"Trailer","name":"Ghibli Fest 2023 Trailer","ytId":"XWHzZ8R_zaI","lang":"en"},{"source":"VCI9-lMBIIE","type":"Trailer","name":"Princess Mononoke 25th Anniversary - In Cinemas July 14","ytId":"VCI9-lMBIIE","lang":"en"},{"source":"rPs1C4277wE","type":"Trailer","name":"Vintage Trailer","ytId":"rPs1C4277wE","lang":"en"},{"source":"4OiMOHRDs14","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer","ytId":"4OiMOHRDs14","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"I1